00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:49.923
to clean the ceiling and the walls.

00:05:50.840 --> 00:05:52.070
Made a right mess in this one.

00:05:52.070 --> 00:05:53.680
I think it was worth it though.

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:54.560
I think it was worth seeing.

